<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index dips 2.4 points to 883.4.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index dips 2.4 points to 883.4.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, lost 2.4 points on Tuesday to 883.4 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Five of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the energy index losing the most, down 14.1 points to 955.1.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
